        <match>
          <premise>random.randint</premise>
          <response>Python function that generates a random integer between two specified values (inclusive)</response>
        </match>
      </cardsort>
    </activity>

  <p>The next lessons in this unit are for practicing Python coding. There are also some optional App Inventor coding projects.</p>

  </section>
